  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#common-input-element-apis\n\n> The value IDL attribute allows scripts to manipulate the value of an input element. The attribute is in one of the following modes, which define its behaviour:​\n\nWhen the HTML spec talks about this value IDL attribute, is it the same as the attributes field in `Element` as defined by the DOM spec? Should every mutation of the value IDL attribute be done through the `setAttribute` method for an `Element`?\n",
